                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Loved this game on the 360 and love it here.\r\n\r\nBasically, its a series of really good and satisfying mechanics that really appeals to kids of the 80s like me when these arcades were everywhere. \r\n\r\nFor the most part, there's a great sense of progression... until there isn't.\r\n\r\nAs other reviewers have alluded to, this feels more like a brilliant demo with a promise of more to come. unfortunately it never did, and that's this game's downfall. We live in hope that the devs one day pick it up and blast us with more!",
